ts coming, we can just say, I forgive.","start":618.86,"end":623.42,"words":[{"text":"If","start":618.86,"end":619.06},{"text":"we","start":619.06,"end":619.2},{"text":"feel","start":619.2,"end":619.5},{"text":"our","start":619.5,"end":619.68},{"text":"thoughts","start":619.68,"end":619.9},{"text":"coming,","start":619.9,"end":620.9},{"text":"we","start":621.4,"end":621.44},{"text":"can","start":621.44,"end":621.66},{"text":"just","start":621.66,"end":621.9},{"text":"say,","start":621.9,"end":622.42},{"text":"I","start":622.42,"end":622.54},{"text":"forgive.","start":622.54,"end":623.42}]},{"text":"I do not need these thoughts.","start":627.1,"end":628.86,"words":[{"text":"I","start":627.1,"end":627.3},{"text":"do","start":627.3,"end":627.46},{"text":"not","start":627.46,"end":627.7},{"text":"need","start":627.7,"end":627.94},{"text":"these","start":627.94,"end":628.24},{"text":"thoughts.","start":628.24,"end":628.86}]},{"text":"I have everything that I need.","start":630.88,"end":633.16,"words":[{"text":"I","start":630.88,"end":631.14},{"text":"have","start":631.14,"end":631.42},{"text":"everything","start":631.42,"end":631.86},{"text":"that","start":631.86,"end":632.24},{"text":"I","start":632.24,"end":632.44},{"text":"need.","start":632.44,"end":633.16}]},{"text":"I forgive.","start":636.52,"end":637.28,"words":[{"text":"I","start":636.52,"end":636.66},{"text":"forgive.","start":636.66,"end":637.28}]},{"text":"Finally,","start":657.26,"end":657.92,"words":[{"text":"Finally,","start":657.26,"end":657.92}]},{"text":"We can bring the right hand on top of the head, pushing the palm down ever so slightly on the fontanelle bone.","start":658.58,"end":666.94,"words":[{"text":"We","start":658.58,"end":658.68},{"text":"can","start":658.68,"end":658.84},{"text":"bring","start":658.84,"end":659.02},{"text":"the","start":659.02,"end":659.22},{"text":"right","start":659.22,"end":659.44},{"text":"hand","start":659.44,"end":659.96},{"text":"on","start":660.38,"end":660.7},{"tex